				"objectNames": [
					"Xavier"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721190101,
					"content": "Oh! Uh, Traveler... Things do not look good.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190102,
					"content": "The Fatui within have concentrated their forces near the core. It seems that they have discovered something.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190103,
					"content": "Surely they don't intend to breach the core's defenses... No, we can no longer afford to delay. We must move now to initiate functionality tests.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190104,
					"content": "Functionality tests?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721190105,
					"content": "By that, I mean that we must test our machine friend's purification abilities. I have no intention of moving it into the furnace only to find that it will not function.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190106,
					"content": "To that end, please help me find 3 Onikabuto, if you will.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190107,
					"content": "I want to place them near the Mikage Furnace, which will cause them to be tainted by Tatarigami.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190108,
					"content": "Then, we will retrieve them, and use this purification device to cleanse them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190109,
					"content": "This is the test I have devised.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190110,
					"content": "Where do I find these Onikabuto?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721190111,
					"content": "Hmm... normally, they are found in Electro-rich environments...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190112,
					"content": "I have also heard that they can survive near the Mikage Furnace. What hardy little critters they are...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190113,
					"content": "Why don't I just snag some from in the furnace, then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721190114,
					"content": "Well, you could do that, but if you were to take Onikabuto directly from the Mikage Furnace for testing...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190115,
					"content": "To tell you the truth, I worry about the reliability of my little machine...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190116,
					"content": "It is best to work through tests step by step, after all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190117,
					"content": "Ahem, well then... please help me find 3 Onikabuto, if you will.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190118,
						721190120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190118,
					"content": "I've got this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721190119,
					"content": "So you do. Just 3 is fine!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190120,
					"content": "I could just take a dip inside the Furnace myself...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721190121,
					"content": "Well... you could use yourself as the test subject, yes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190122,
					"content": "But like I said before, this device's reliability may not meet expectations.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190123,
					"content": "If something unexpected truly does happen during the purification process, you might... uh, encounter some unforeseen issues...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190124,
					"content": "Ahem. Let's just stick to using the Onikabuto for now, shall we?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721190125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				},
				{
					"id": 721190125,
					"content": "Just 3 will do! Once you've caught them, just bring them back here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Xavier"
				}
			]
		},
